{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05850","headline":"秋夜独坐怀内弟崔兴宗 · 王维","name":"秋夜独坐怀内弟崔兴宗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜静羣动息，蟪蛄声悠悠。\n庭槐北风响，日夕方高秋。\n思子整羽翰，及时当云浮。\n吾生将白首，岁晏思沧州。\n高足在旦暮，肯爲南亩俦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05850.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05850","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}